      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A giant black eye with two enormous wings and two tiny legs. It has the ability to blind or confuse its prey and picks off the weak ones within the group.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 21, touch 15, flat-footed 16 (+4 Dex, +1 dodge, +6 natural)</p><p>hp 76 [108] (9d8+36)</p><p>Fort +7, Ref +7, Will +7</p><p>Immune Blind and Sleep status effects</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft.; Fly 30 ft. (good)</p><p>Melee Bite +8 (1d8+3)</p><p>Space 5 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Confusing Glare, Critical Attack, Curse Gaze, Umbral Storm</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 14, Dex 19, Con 18, Int 10, Wis 12, Cha 16</p><p>Base Atk +6; CMB +8; CMD 23</p><p>Feats Dodge, Improved Initiative, Improved Natural Attack (Bite), Mobility, Skill Focus (Perception)</p><p>Skills Fly +20, Intimidate +18, Knowledge (arcana) +15, Perception +16</p><p>Languages Infernal, Abyssal</p>"
      }
